Python","description":"We used an image classifier to identify dog breeds. For this image classification task we used an image classification application using a deep learning model called a convolutional neural network (often abbreviated as CNN). CNNs work particularly well for detecting features in images like colors, textures, and edges; then using these features to identify objects in the images. I used a CNN that has already learned the features from a giant dataset of 1.2 million images called ImageNet. There are different types of CNNs that have different structures (architectures) that work better or worse depending on your criteria. With this project you'll explore the three different architectures (AlexNet, VGG, and ResNet).","topics":[],"score":2510,"global_rank":63028,"final_score":2510,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":11480},{"name":"Chris-Johnston/ledcap","owner":"Chris-Johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/Chris-Johnston/ledcap","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"An animated RGB LED graduation cap, running on a Raspberry Pi.","topics":[],"score":2510,"global_rank":63033,"final_score":2510,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":11481},{"name":"ianfoo/twilio-sms","owner":"ianfoo","html_url":"https://github.com/ianfoo/twilio-sms","stars":2,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Example Python Flask app for sending and receiving SMS with Twilio.","topics":[],"score":2510,"global_rank":63034,"final_score":2510,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":11482},{"name":"annaymj/LeetCode","owner":"annaymj","html_url":"https://github.com/annaymj/LeetCode","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python Data Structure and Algorithm ","topics":[],"score":2510,"global_rank":63038,"final_score":2510,"on_pypi":false,"python_rank":11483},{"name":"bit-jax/class_projects","owner":"bit-jax","html_url":"https://github.com/bit-jax/class_projects","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"is